https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a>:</b> There is no material defined for this item.  Quivers and cosmetic/store items have no listed material.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000005000</span>5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">8 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary version</a> of <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Sword_of_Shadow\" title=\"Item:Epic Sword of Shadow\">Epic Sword of Shadow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Sword_of_Shadow.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Sword_of_Shadow.png/420px-Legendary_Sword_of_Shadow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"275\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Sword_of_Shadow.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This great sword was forged inside the Vault of Night itself. The essence of Shadow has seeped inside this sword granting it exceptional death-dealing abilities. So much, in fact, that the very act of actually wielding it would simply tear through the universe itself.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>Equips to&#160;: Cosmetic Main Hand\n</p><p>When Legendary Crafting was introduced, the devs opted not to provide a legendary version of this infamously powerful weapon, reasoning that it would render every other legendary martial weapon completely obsolete. Instead, this cosmetic version has a unique appearance based on early Vault of Night concept art.\n</p><p><b>Again, to stress:</b> the Legendary version of this item is cosmetic only, and you will <b>no longer be able to use it</b> as a main hand weapon. Keep the item at Epic if you want to actually attack anything with it.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221101\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.117 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2631